  "description": "REWPEQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C6 H16 N1 1+,C78 H84 Dy6 N18 O37 1-,9(C1 H4 O1),7(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.873-4.148 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.72-120.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L6-2H)6(O)(CH3COO)6](HNEt3)(H2O)16(CH3OH)14. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 16 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
